  "minimum_validated_version": "0.44.2",
  "summary": "Full isolated validator passes on zellij 0.44.2, 0.44.3, 0.45.0 and 0.45.1. 0.44.1 introduced focus-pane-id and confirmed every single-client selection but failed the two-client step. 0.44.0 and older lack focus-pane-id; the adapter reported an honest selection failure wherever it ran. No version produced a false success.",
  "provenance": "live",
  "method": "Upstream GitHub release tarballs for x86_64-unknown-linux-musl (the no-web build where published), each extracted into its own new scratch directory and run only through a temporary PATH prefix, never installed. Tarballs were checked against the GitHub asset digest where the API publishes one, and each binary against the release .sha256sum. validation/zellij.py ran per version with private sockets, config, cache, data and PTYs; Andre's default zellij socket directory was never used.",
  "host_binary_note": "The host's own zellij 0.45.1 binary has the same sha256 as the upstream 0.45.1 no-web musl binary and passed the same validator as a control run.",
